          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.086,
            0.459,
            0.106
          ],
          "content": "**(c) Sum of 5 even numbers**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.109,
            0.45,
            0.128
          ],
          "content": "**(d) Sum of 8 odd numbers**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.132,
            0.17,
            0.148
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.15,
            0.352,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": "(a) Even number"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.17,
            0.352,
            0.189
          ],
          "content": "(b) Even number"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.189,
            0.352,
            0.208
          ],
          "content": "(c) Even number"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.209,
            0.352,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": "(d) Even number"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.237,
            0.926,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": "**2. Lakpa has an odd number of ₹1 coins, an odd number of ₹5 coins and an even number of ₹10 coins in his piggy bank. He calculated the total and got ₹205. Did he make a mistake? If he did, explain why. If he didn’t, how many coins of each type could he have?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.316,
            0.169,
            0.333
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.336,
            0.501,
            0.355
          ],
          "content": "Lakpa must have made a mistake!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.356,
            0.698,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": "The total can never be ₹205 with the given coin counts."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.394,
            0.321,
            0.413
          ],
          "content": "**3. We know that:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.423,
            0.396,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": "**(a) even + even = even**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.451,
            0.378,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": "**(b) odd + odd = even**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.48,
            0.376,
            0.501
          ],
          "content": "**(c) even + odd = odd**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.509,
            0.715,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": "**Similarly, find out the parity for the scenarios below:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.539,
            0.394,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": "(d) even – even ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.566,
            0.374,
            0.589
          ],
          "content": "(e) odd – odd ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.596,
            0.38,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "(f) even – odd = \\_"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.624,
            0.381,
            0.646
          ],
          "content": "(g) odd – even ="
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.655,
            0.17,
            0.673
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Ans:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.683,
            0.254,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": "(d) Even"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.705,
            0.253,
            0.724
          ],
          "content": "(e) Even"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.725,
            0.242,
            0.744
          ],
          "content": "(f) Odd"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.746,
            0.244,
            0.767
          ],
          "content": "(g) Odd"
